expr_resistor: a resistor whose value is an expression, at the top level (every VACASK resistor has a model): written for ngspice as `r1 in 0 {expr} resistor`, which ngspice-45 rejects ("unknown parameter (resistor)"); the literal form `r1 in 0 3k resistor` runs
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
parameters k=3.0
v1 (in 0) vsource dc=1.0
r1 (in 0) resistor r=1k*k
control
  analysis op1 op
endc
